  "$comment": "The townsfolk templates' looks (journal Passe PN1; the operator's GP-04 note « Mais les pnjs peuvent etre des combattants eux-meme personne ne se bat vraiment pour d'ou la volonte de conception generique avec des declinaisons de peau cheveux, couleur de vetement et armes etc... », answer « Gabarits d'abord (Recommandé) », journal Passe GP2). Ren's look's shape (src/characters/HeroLook.ts): per template sheet, the skin's palette mask, the hair (its colours inside each frame's head rectangle) and the clothes ('cloak': the shirt, or the bodice and the skirt, by their own blues); the ramps a townsperson's look picks from (src/characters/NpcLook.ts: one look per person, src/narrative/npcFighters.ts); every ramp « proposé ». Reaches production only with approved: true from the operator (the art sheet of chantier 1), each sheet's material fingerprint checked at load.",
